.tlg006.perseus-grc1:2:1:9"},"; ",{"g":"ἧκέ νυν ταχύ"}," come back soon, ",{"c":"Ar. Pax 275","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0019.tlg005.perseus-grc1:275"},"; ",{"g":"ἄψορρον ἥξεις"},{"c":"A. Pr. 1021","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.tlg003.perseus-grc1:1021"},"; ",{"g":"ἄψορρον ἥξομεν πάλιν"},{"c":"S. El. 53","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tlg005.perseus-grc1:53"},". "]],[3,"4",[" c. part., ",{"g":"ἥκω φέρων"}," I have come bringing (i.e. with), ",{"c":"Id. OC 579","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tlg007.perseus-grc1:579"},", cf. ",{"c":"357","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tlg007.perseus-grc1:357"},", ",{"c":"Ar. Pax 265","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0019.tlg005.perseus-grc1:265"},", ",{"c":"Eup. 22","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0461.tlg001:22"}," D., ",{"c":"Pl. Grg. 518d","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0059.tlg023:518d"},"; ",{"g":"ἧκεν ἄγων"},{"c":"Id. Phd. 117a","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0059.tlg004.perseus-grc1:117a"},"; ",{"g":"ἕτερόν τι ἥκεις ἕχων"},{"c":"Id. Grg. 491c","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0059.tlg023:491c"},", etc.: c. fut. part., like ",{"g":"ἔρχομαι, ἥκω φράσων, ἀγγελῶν"},", etc., I am going, I intend to say, ",{"c":"E. Ph. 706","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.tlg015.perseus-grc1:706"},", ",{"c":"1075","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.tlg015.perseus-grc1:1075"},", etc. "]],[3,"5",[" to have come to be, ",{"g":"θεοῖς ἔχθιστος ἥκω"},{"c":"S. OT 1519","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tlg004.perseus-grc1:1519"}," (troch.), cf.",{"c":"Aj. 636","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tlg003.perseus-grc1:636"},"(lyr.), ",{"c":"El. 1201","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tlg005.perseus-grc1:1201"},", etc.; take one's origin, ",{"g":"ἀπὸ πολιτειῶν τοιούτων ἥκετε, ἐν αἷς . . "},{"c":"Th. 4.126","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0003.tlg001.perseus-grc1:4:126"},". "]],[2,"II",[" of things, in various uses: of meats, to have come to table, ",{"c":"Alex. 132","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0402.tlg001:132"},"; ",{"g":"ὡς τὰ περιφερόμενα ἧκε πρὸς ἡμᾶς"},{"c":"X. Cyr. 2.2.3","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0032.tlg007.perseus-grc1:2:2:3"},"; of reports, ",{"g":"ἐμοὶ ἀγγελίη ἥκει παρὰ βασιλέος"},{"c":"Hdt. 8.140","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0016.tlg001.perseus-grc1:8:140"},".",{"g":"ά"},", cf. ",{"c":"S. OC 1177","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tlg007.perseus-grc1:1177"},"; of events, ",{"g":"πῆμα ἥκει τινί"},{"c":"A. Pr. 103","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.tlg003.perseus-grc1:103"},", cf. ",{"c":"Ar. Ra. 606","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0019.tlg009.perseus-grc1:606"},", etc.; ",{"g":"ἐπ' ἀνδρὶ ἥκει βίον τελευτή"},{"c":"S. OC 1472","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tlg007.perseus-grc1:1472"},"; ",{"g":"ἵν' ἥκειτὰ μαντ εύματα"}," what they have come to, ",{"c":"Id. OT 953","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tlg004.perseus-grc1:953"},"; ",{"g":"ὡς αὐτὸν ἥξοι μοῖρα"}," ib.",{"c":"713","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tlg004.perseus-grc1:713"}," codd.; ",{"g":"ἥξει πόλεμος"}," Orac. ap. ",{"c":"Th. 2.54","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0003.tlg001.perseus-grc1:2:54"},"; ",{"g":"ἐς αὐτὸν ἥξει τὸ δεινόν"},{"c":"Id. 6.77","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0003.tlg001.perseus-grc1:6:77"},"; of Time, ",{"g":"ἥκει ἦμαρ, νύξ"},", ",{"c":"A. Ag. 1301","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.tlg005.perseus-grc1:1301"},", ",{"c":"E. IT 42","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.tlg013.perseus-grc1:42"},"; ",{"g":"ἥκει ὑμῖν ὁ καιρός"},{"c":"Lys. 12.79","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0540.tlg012.perseus-grc1:79"},"; ",{"g":"τὸ μέλλον ἥξει"},{"c":"A. Ag. 1240","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.tlg005.perseus-grc1:1240"},". "]],[3,"2",[" concern, relate to, ",{"g":"ποῖ λόγος ἥκει"},"; to what do the words relate? ",{"c":"E. Tr. 154","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.tlg011.perseus-grc1:154"}," (lyr.); ",{"g":"εἰς ἔμ' ἥκει . . τὰ πράγματα"},{"c":"Ar. Pl. 919","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0019.tlg011.perseus-grc1:919"},"; ",{"g":"εἰς ἐμὲ τὸ ἐλλεῖπον ἥξει"}," will fall upon me, ",{"c":"X. Cyr. 1.5.13","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0032.tlg007.perseus-grc1:1:5:13"},": freq. in part., ",{"g":"τὰ εἰς τοὺς κινδύνους ἥκοντα"},{"c":"Antipho 5.81","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0028.tlg005.perseus-grc1:81"},